# Cloud services
user svc-ingest
topic read site/+/dev/+/telemetry
topic read site/+/dev/+/status
topic read site/+/gw/status
topic read site/+/cmd/+/ack
topic read site/+/job/+/result

user svc-api
topic write site/+/cmd/+
topic write site/+/job/+
topic write site/+/config
topic read site/+/cmd/+/ack
topic read site/+/job/+/result
topic read site/+/gw/status

# The rules service sends approved commands (P3-04); acks come back through ingest.
user svc-rules
topic write site/+/cmd/+

user svc-health
topic read $SYS/#

# Gateways: the certificate CN is the site id, so a gateway can only reach its own site.
pattern readwrite site/%u/#
